# Icon assets
#
# Tray (macOS menu bar):
# - trayIconTemplate.png, trayIconTemplate@2x.png (idle)
# - trayIcon-uploadingTemplate.png, trayIcon-uploadingTemplate@2x.png
# - trayIcon-errorTemplate.png, trayIcon-errorTemplate@2x.png
# Template images should be grayscale/black; system adjusts for light/dark menu bar.
#
# App icon (packaged build):
# - icon.png (512x512) — used for macOS DMG/app; generated from tray icon for alpha.
#   Replace with a 1024x1024 PNG or icon.icns for production if desired.
# - icon.ico (Windows) — add when building for Windows.
